    {
      "id": "les-e-03",
      "rank": "E",
      "module": "mod-e-1",
      "title": "to be: отрицание isn't / aren't",
      "grammar_point": {
        "id": "gp-e-03",
        "title_ru": "Отрицание с to be",
        "rule_md": "Отрицание с to be — частица **not** после глагола:\n\n- I am **not** a teacher. (сокращение только I'm not)\n- He / She / It **is not** = **isn't** here.\n- You / We / They **are not** = **aren't** ready.\n\nСемья: mother, father, brother, sister, parents, family.\n\nМножественное число без артикля: My parents are doctors. My friends are students.",
